 .../RenderDll/Common/RendererCVars.h          |  1 +
 .../GraphicsPipeline/DepthOfField.cpp         | 11 +++++-
 .../CinematicCamera/docs/ConsoleReference.md  |  7 ++++
 .../Shaders/HWScripts/CryFX/DepthOfField.cfx  | 34 +++++++++++--------
 5 files changed, 46 insertions(+), 15 deletions(-)

